     "html": "Eta <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">if </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>−</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">kj</mtext></msub></mrow></math>  denez:"
