       "mota": "testua",
       "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">su </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">ing </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></math>"
